  "prefLabel": "He-M 1202.11 Appeals",
  "priorExpiration": "2012-03-19",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "He-M 1202.11 Appeals.\n\n(a) A request for appeal pursuant to He-M 1202.10(b) shall be submitted in writing to the director within 10 days following the date of the notification of revocation of authorization of a provider to administer medication or designation of a nurse trainer.\n\n(b) The director shall immediately forward the request to the administrative appeals unit so that an appeal proceeding can be scheduled.\n\n(c) Appeals shall be conducted in accordance with He-C 200.\n\nSource. #7957, eff 9-19-03; ss by #9978, INTERIM, eff 9-19-11, EXPIRED: 3-19-12\n\nNew. #12192, eff 5-26-17 (from He-M 1202.12)",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/he-m1200.html"
